## Code map

| Cũ (trong `AdminVietNamLogictic/`) | Mới (`vcl-forntend`) |
|------------------------------------|----------------------|
| `src/api/**/**Service.js` | `src/modules/<feature>/{api,mock,mappers,index}.js` |
| `src/pages/SalePage/...` | `src/app/pages/sales/...` |
| `src/pages/AdminPage/...` | `src/app/pages/admin/...` |
| `AppRoutes.jsx` + `PrivateRoute` | `appRoutes.js` + `routeAccess.js` + middleware + AuthGuard |
| `sessionStorage` auth | `authSession.js` + cookie middleware |
| Ant Design / MUI | Tailwind + component sẵn có |

